    <guid isPermaLink="false">677531501e823e72d371840a</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 01 Jan 2025 12:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>旷野时刻第二季第一期，邀请到的嘉宾是</span><a href="https://xhslink.com/m/CL2sbCs90c" data-url="https://xhslink.com/m/CL2sbCs90c"><span>阿朱</span></a><span>。</span></p><p><span>阿朱，94年生，旷野时刻2023至今，自媒体博主。</span></p><p><span>生长在重男轻女家庭的十几岁，阿朱早早学会了独立。</span></p><p><span>奋力奔跑努力攒钱的二十几岁，阿朱实现了自己初到上海时定下的存款百万的目标。</span></p><p><span>旅居大理做自媒体博主的三十岁，阿朱说：“三十岁是我重生的第一岁。”</span></p><p><span>🌍</span><strong><span>Show Notes</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="72">01:12</a> 毕业之后的三份工作</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="606">10:06</a> 我的灵魂在工位上腐烂</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="762">12:42</a> &nbsp;我实现了三十岁存款百万的梦想</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2206">36:46</a> 重男轻女的家庭让我学会了独立</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2834">47:14</a> 自媒体收入管道大公开</span></p><p><span>🌍</span><strong><span>音乐</span></strong></p><p><span>《沧海轻舟》李健</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqnEwY-Q_B1vCLwlfjZXS2mpX70V.png"></figure><p></p>]]></description>
